eds the mandate range, investigate:\n\n**Portfolio**\n- Replication method (full vs. sampling) and optimizer residuals\n- Cash drag from subscriptions, dividends, or redemptions\n- Rebalance and reconstitution timing versus index effective dates\n- Corporate-action handling (splits, spin-offs, mergers)\n- Sector or issuer constraints that force deviations\n\n**Pricing**\n- Closing-price source and timing versus index calculation\n- Stale or erroneous security prices\n- Dividend ex-date and reinvestment treatment in the benchmark versus the fund\n\n**Operating**\n- Trading costs and market impact on creations and redemptions\n- Securities lending income offsetting drag\n- Expense accruals and withholding tax reclaims\n- Settlement failures and reconciliation errors","ttft_ms":4840,"type":"result","duration_ms":5981,"uuid":"def2114f-6f3e-4bdd-be2d-568fb845ee41","ttft_stream_ms":415,"time_to_request_ms":66,"first_content_frame_ms":415,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
